; Behaviour block: a skeleton archer (kind 10, rooms 17 and 21)
;
; Used by the white skeleton archers of The wheel of faith and Evil church (attribute $47, 24 pixels tall), which shoot
; arrows left or right. Layout after the 5 header bytes (hit box as in #R$93D3): attribute, sprite height, sprite width
; in bytes, then the sprite lists of the two directions (two frames each).
@label=BehaviourArcher
b$951B DEFB $03,$01,$0B,$06,$02  ; hit box top, left, bottom, right (2-pixel units); slot +$15 (Unknown)
 $9520 DEFB $47,$0C,$02  ; attribute, sprite height (2-pixel units), width (bytes)
@isub=DEFW BehaviourArcher+$C
 $9523 DEFW $9527    ; sprites, first direction (left)
@isub=DEFW BehaviourArcher+$10
 $9525 DEFW $952B    ; sprites, second direction (right)
 $9527 DEFW $D7F8    ; first direction, frame 0
 $9529 DEFW $D7FA    ; first direction, frame 1
 $952B DEFW $D7FC    ; second direction, frame 0
 $952D DEFW $D7FE    ; second direction, frame 1
